// Regime Catalog key is `(code, person_type)`; e.g. 626 exists as RESICO PF and RESICO PM. `treatment` is the support level; `income_basis` is the date an income of the regime books on (the single source; `TaxpayerRegime` embeds the same value). `incompatible_with` is symmetric (if A lists B, B lists A) and only applies to overlapping period windows; an absent pair is allowed.
//
// Examples: {"code":"626","explanation":null,"income_basis":"cash","incompatible_with":[{"code":"606","reason":"El RESICO cubre los ingresos por arrendamiento (art. 113-E LISR)."},{"code":"612","reason":"El RESICO sustituye al régimen de actividad empresarial y profesional (art. 113-E LISR)."}],"name":"Régimen Simplificado de Confianza","option_defs":[],"person_type":"fisica","required_inputs":[],"treatment":"full"}
